Konrad,

I can confirm that this fixes the segfault:

diff -ru ast2ast/inst/include/etr_bits/Core/Types.hpp ast2ast-1/inst/include/etr_bits/Core/Types.hpp
--- ast2ast/inst/include/etr_bits/Core/Types.hpp        2026-10-22 01:10:13
+++ ast2ast-1/inst/include/etr_bits/Core/Types.hpp      2026-10-27 18:11:54
@@ -421,8 +421,10 @@
   std::size_t inline_[N_INLINE];
   bool on_heap() const noexcept { return heap_ != nullptr; }
   void release() noexcept {
-    delete[] heap_;
-    heap_ = nullptr;
+    if (heap_ != nullptr) {
+      delete[] heap_;
+      heap_ = nullptr;
+    }
     rank_ = 0;
   }
   void copy_from(const Dim& o) {


but there is one more suspicions delete without check in resize() [Types.hpp at 511] so you may want to review that one as well.

Cheers,
Simon



